# L §5.11 as if: "known D: the cut K inside."  The row of v2 is known 2026-06-01: inside as if {known 2026-03-01}
# only v1's row is seen.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input n: int

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  n = 1

version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-06-01
  replace n = 2

ask q1: n, n as if {known 2026-03-01}
=== expect
q1: (2, 1)
  pinned: known 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-12-31
